Wed Sep 30 14:35:22 UTC 2026 - Jan Baier <jbaier@suse.cz>

- Enforce noexec,nosuid,nodev on /tmp inside the krun guest: the
  guest mounts it without the --tmpfs flags, so the entrypoint
  remounts /tmp before dropping privileges.
- Silence the 'tty: ttyname error' printed on every shell start
  under krun by redirecting stderr of the GPG_TTY lookup in
  /etc/bash.bashrc.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Wed Sep 30 12:14:12 UTC 2026 - Jan Baier <jbaier@suse.cz>

- Support custom working directory (-w <folder>) and arbitrary
  command execution in paddock run.
- Always route command execution through a login shell so profile
  scripts and environment variables are initialized.
- Validate -w directory paths against traversal and symlink escapes.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Tue Sep 22 09:47:48 UTC 2026 - Jan Baier <jbaier@suse.cz>

- Drop the jq/openssl BuildRequires: gemini-cli is now installed from
  the distro repo instead of a hand-verified npm tarball, so the
  'upgrade' subcommand (and its jq/openssl/curl dependency) is gone.

